2026-07-04T22:37:05+0100 Zipper Range matching-border child laziness:
- Tightened the direct matching-child cases in `SpaceZipper.Range`, `LastRange`, and `DropLastRange`.
- `Range.child(item)` now returns `Range(child, localLo, localHi)` for the matching border child instead of asking that child for `pathCount` to decide whether it is fully included.
- `LastRange.child(item)` now returns `LastRange(child, remaining)` for the matching right-border child; `DropLastRange.child(item)` similarly returns `DropLastRange(child, remaining)`.
